 },
 "summary": "A single red surface-mount LED in the 0603 (1.6 × 0.8 mm) chip outline, 0.6 mm tall, behind a transparent flat lens. At 20 mA it gives 145 to 300 mcd at a 615 to 630 nm dominant wavelength with a forward drop of 1.8 to 2.4 V and a 120 degree viewing angle. Parts are sorted into intensity, voltage and wavelength bins. It suits automatic placement and infrared reflow, is RoHS compliant, and ships 4000 to a reel on 8 mm tape.",
